{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy gets up under a blanket he doesn't remember bringing. After a moment he spots Ed resting nearby. \"Hey, Kukudh?\"\n`Need something?`\n\"Let's bring Ed some breakfast in a few, just a note for later.\"\n`Anything specific?`\n\"Whatever's the meal of the day at Voice.\"\n`Glad you recognize my elite skills.`\n\nRoy wanders to the cottage for a moment, and returns soon afterwards, after which he walks over to the biggest pond nearby.\n\"Hey Gil. I hope your new job's treating ya well. Wow, I'm not any good at this whole prayer thing, am I? I'll have to ask Sab or Irynx for advice. We're planning to go west soon, after the city's all fine. I have an idea for what we could also do here that should serve it for a while. I hope Edriata won't mind that in her neighborhood. Well, I'll keep you updated as usual.\"","created_at":"2021-08-23T05:01:30.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879228838633152612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(so I feel like Sabrine doesn't realise Gil would have to actually die to be promoted rather than just... whoops life upgrade, despite having gone through a similar thing :v she currently thinks he didn't have to die after all, so that's my reasoning for waiting with dramatics until Ed tells us about it)\n\nSabrine slowly awakes, wondering how she turned into a burrito overnight. she looks into the pond, quietly praying, 'Grant me the power to protect the city, the wisdom to know how to help, and the courage to do what I must against all odds.'\nshe struggles to get up for a minute, before adding, '...and the strength to get out of this blanket.' laughing slightly, she rolls around until the blanket is untangled, goes to give Roy a pseudo-morning hug, and heads into the cottage.","created_at":"2021-08-23T05:25:50.150000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879234961218093056","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
